    "prompt": "Turn a strong 10-second talking-head quote into a cinematic landscape edit. Keep the speaker and any source lower-third fully visible, place one restrained title behind the subject, add accurate word-timed captions above the bottom safe area, preserve the original voice, and use my brand kit for the logo and caption accents.",
